Purpose: opt-in (PANVK_BC_DROP_RAW=1) dropping of the raw BCn blocks of fragment-decoded BC images (only the decoded copy is sampled): 25-50% less memory per BC texture for memory-bound games, at the cost of BC readback; off by default because readback is valid Vulkan
